WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.101 --> 00:00:03.436
-I -- Guys, I have a book out --

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:06.439
coming out called
"Nana Loves You More."

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:09.942
I'm very excited about it.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.942 --> 00:00:13.980
This is -- This one --
This one's $17.99.

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:16.582
-Ooh.
-Yeah, $1,799.

00:00:16.582 --> 00:00:18.550
-Wow, okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:19.919
-Look at what you get here.
-That's a lot of pages.

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:21.320
-Look at the thickness.

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:22.455
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:24.357
-And in there, but this --
this is the --

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:25.724
this is the new --
in this series,

00:00:25.724 --> 00:00:27.827
you have "Dada," you have
"Mama," "Baby," "Nana."

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:29.095
But I'm gonna get into it.

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:32.031
I want to have a theme week --
a nana theme week.

00:00:32.031 --> 00:00:35.235
Next week is all --
We're gonna celebrate grandmas

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:37.970
around the country,
and we love grandmas,

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:40.339
and so check our socials.

00:00:40.339 --> 00:00:43.242
We're gonna -- We might need
your grandmas to participate

00:00:43.242 --> 00:00:44.810
and do something fun
for our show.

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:47.347
So check the @FallonTonight
or @JimmyFallon.

00:00:47.347 --> 00:00:48.448
It's gonna be fun.

